sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CC as ConnectController
    participant LC as LobbyController
    participant LGC as LiveGameController
    participant SC as ServerConnection
    participant TSC as TournamentServerController
    participant VB as ViewerBroadcaster

    Note over CC,VB: Tournament is already running in background (POST /start returned 202)

    User->>CC: enter IP + port → click Connect
    CC->>SC: new ServerConnection(baseUrl)
    CC->>LC: navigate to LobbyController

    LC->>SC: fetchTournaments()
    SC->>TSC: GET /tournaments
    TSC-->>SC: [{id, name, status: "RUNNING"}]
    SC-->>LC: List~TournamentInfo~
    LC->>LC: populate tournament list

    User->>LC: select RUNNING tournament → click Watch
    LC->>LGC: navigate to LiveGameController

    LGC->>SC: streamMoves(tournamentId, onEvent, onDone)
    SC->>TSC: GET /tournaments/{id}/stream
    TSC->>VB: addEmitter(emitter)
    SC-->>LGC: CompletableFuture~Void~

    Note over TSC,VB: Game round executes on background thread

    VB->>VB: onMoveMade(event) → serialize to MoveEventDTO JSON
    VB->>TSC: emitter.send(json)
    TSC-->>SC: data: {"type":"MOVE",...}
    SC->>SC: parse SSE line → MoveEventDTO
    SC->>LGC: Platform.runLater(onEvent)
    LGC->>LGC: append move to text area

    Note over TSC,VB: Repeat for each round...

    VB->>VB: onTournamentOver(result)
    VB->>TSC: emitter.send(TOURNAMENT_OVER) + emitter.complete()
    TSC-->>SC: data: {"type":"TOURNAMENT_OVER"}
    SC->>LGC: Platform.runLater(onDone)
    LGC->>LGC: show final standings

    alt User clicks Back before tournament ends
        User->>LGC: click Back
        LGC->>SC: future.cancel()
        SC->>TSC: HTTP connection closes
        TSC->>VB: emitter.onCompletion fires → remove from list
        LGC->>LC: navigate back to LobbyController
    end
